
~ title

The Meadows

=>


~ start

set temp.hunt = 60
set temp.forage = 1
do temp.hunt = (temp.hunt * player.get_efficiency()) / 100

As you travel, you [[encounter|find]] a large, [[sprawling|lush]] meadow.
	[br]There is a herd of [b]cows[/b] [[roaming|feeding on]] the [[fields|land]].

- Attempt to hunt cows (+ 2-4 food) ({{temp.hunt}}% success)
	if chance(temp.hunt, 100)
		set temp.food_amount = _randi_range(2, 4)
		do inventory.add(Items.FOOD, temp.food_amount)
		
		You hunt and get [b]{{temp.food_amount}}[/b] food.
	else
		set temp.damage = -5 + _randi_range(0, -5)
		do player.apply_stat(Character.Stat.HEALTH, temp.damage )

		The hunt fails. You are injured.
			[color=red]{{temp.damage}}[/color] health.

- Forage (+ 1-2 food)
	set temp.food_amount = _randi_range(1, 2)
	do inventory.add(Items.FOOD, temp.food_amount)

	You [[forage|harvest|find|collect]] [b]{{temp.food_amount}}[/b] food.

- Ignore
	=> END

=> end


~ desert

=> END


~ end

- Leave

=> END